{
  "Title": "ELSA-2026-98455:  webkit2gtk3 security, bug fix, and enhancement update (CRITICAL)",
  "Description": "[2.54.2-3]\n- Update bundled ANGLE to 751417514a52 and Skia to ca84ce0a6f16, both from\n  Chromium's M157 milestone.\n- Move exception handling in JSGlobalObject to fix crashes with our downstream\n  icu-67.patch\n\n[2.54.2-2]\n- Update bundled Skia to aa789d9bd566\n\n[2.54.2-1]\n- Update to 2.54.2\n\n[2.54.1-1]\n- Update to 2.54.1\n- Add patch to update ANGLE even further\n\n[2.54.0-2]\n- Add patch to fix Eclipse crash on startup\n\n[2.54.0-1]\n- Update to 2.54.0\n\n[2.52.5-1]\n- Update to 2.52.5\n\n[2.52.4-1]\n- Update to 2.52.4\n\n[2.52.3-1]\n- Update to 2.52.3\n\n[2.50.4-1]\n- Update to 2.50.4",
